      "message": "This is actually keeping the logic from earlier. Because in old implementation of UiccCard.java:\n            // Reload the carrier privilege rules if necessary.\n            log(\"Before privilege rules: \" + mCarrierPrivilegeRules + \" : \" + mCardState);\n            if (mCarrierPrivilegeRules \u003d\u003d null \u0026\u0026 mCardState \u003d\u003d CardState.CARDSTATE_PRESENT) {\n                mCarrierPrivilegeRules \u003d new UiccCarrierPrivilegeRules(this,\n                        mHandler.obtainMessage(EVENT_CARRIER_PRIVILEGES_LOADED));\n            } else if (mCarrierPrivilegeRules !\u003d null\n                    \u0026\u0026 mCardState !\u003d CardState.CARDSTATE_PRESENT) {\n                mCarrierPrivilegeRules \u003d null;\n            }\n\nSo in order to keep the same logic, we have to do similar things.\n\nI noticed this issue when I did some tests, and the first implementation of UiccProfile is actually incorrect.",
